---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Now" description="What Emilio Zavala Miceli is focused on right now.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
  <h1 class="serif mt-4 text-4xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">What I'm doing now</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-stone-500">Updated October 2026 · México</p>
  <p class="mt-8 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">I'm in the León internship online, and I'm living in México while I go to Spain.</p>
  <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
    <section><h2 class="serif text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">Building scouting tools at Club León</h2><p class="mt-3">Since August 2026 I've been working remotely from México as a Data Analyst & Software Development Intern at Club León FC, building a tool that helps scouts create player profiles and reports and compare prospects with less manual work.</p></section>
    <section><h2 class="serif text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">Starting to freelance</h2><p class="mt-3">I'm taking on my first clients: finishing AI-built MVPs, dashboards, Python automation and chatbots. The first five projects are free in exchange for a testimonial. <a class="link" href="/work-with-me">Details →</a></p></section>
    <section><h2 class="serif text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">Getting ready for Valencia</h2><p class="mt-3">In February 2027 I move to Valencia, Spain, for a master's. Right now that means paperwork, saving, and planning how to keep working while I study.</p></section>
    <section><h2 class="serif text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">Writing in public</h2><p class="mt-3">Starting this site, and practicing business analysis by writing it down. <a class="link" href="/writing">Read →</a></p></section>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-14 text-sm text-stone-500">This is a <a class="link" href="https://nownownow.com/about">now page</a>.</p>
</Base>
